# T114: Update all with four outdated apps: a plan and a confirmation for each, PB Store itself last, then the summary.
# scenario updates
size 1404 1872
wait 400
tap refresh
waitfor catalogLine Catalog last updated
tap menu
tap menuUpdateAll
waitfor planSummary Update App app-01
expect topBarTitle Updating 1 of 4: App app-01
tap consent 0
tap consent 1
tap confirm
waitfor planSummary Update App app-02
expect topBarTitle Updating 2 of 4: App app-02
tap consent 0
tap consent 1
tap confirm
waitfor planSummary Update App app-03
expect topBarTitle Updating 3 of 4: App app-03
tap consent 0
tap consent 1
tap confirm
waitfor planSummary Update App pbstore
expect topBarTitle Updating 4 of 4: App pbstore
shot @OUT@/31-update-all-store-last.png
tap consent 0
tap consent 1
tap confirm
waitfor resultText Updated:
expect resultText App app-01
expect resultText App pbstore
shot @OUT@/32-update-all-summary.png
tap ok
waitfor appRow
expect_absent menuUpdateAll
quit
